B.Wl=new A.dQ("inspect-washer-drain-filter","Look at the drain filter or coin trap","Unplug the washer (or switch off its breaker) before opening a filter cover. Do not split a sealed tub or pump. Place a pan only after this look if you later open the access.","At the lower front corner of the cabinet, find the small square access door or twist-off knob for the coin trap / drain filter. From outside, look whether lint or coins are packed in that opening. Do not unscrew a sealed pump.","You can see the typical access, and from outside it is not stuffed with lint, coins, or sludge.","The trap looks packed with lint, coins, or sludge, or the cover cannot seat. Still do not split a sealed pump.","washer","washer-drain-filter-access",B.dA,B.xe,"washer-drain-filter-access")
B.iG=s(["washer-drain-hose-not-seated"],t.s)
