B.Wu=new A.dQ("inspect-washer-standpipe","Look at the drain hose in the standpipe","Unplug the washer before pulling it out or reaching behind it. Do not split a sealed tub or pump. No live electrical testing.","Behind the washer, find the drain hose end. It should sit inside the vertical standpipe (or hooked over a laundry tub) with a clip or hook holding it so it cannot slip out onto the floor.","The hose is seated in the standpipe (or tub) and looks clipped or hooked so it cannot drop out.","The hose is hanging free, barely hooked, or water would pour on the floor instead of into the pipe \u2014 a common after-move or new-install miss.","washer","washer-standpipe-hose",B.dA,B.iG,"washer-standpipe-hose")
