B.Wz=new A.dQ("inspect-fridge-door-seal","Look at the door gasket","Do not cut or stretch the gasket off its channel. Do not open the sealed cooling system. No live electrical testing.","Close each door until it sits flush. Look along the rubber gasket for gaps, tears, or food in the seal. A dollar-bill tug at the gasket should feel snug, not slide out freely.","Each door stays shut and the gasket looks clean, intact, and seated.","A door pops open, or the gasket has a gap, tear, or sticky food in the seal.","fridge","fridge-door-seal",B.j1,B.a9y,"fridge-door-seal")
B.a7U=s(["blocked-fridge-coils-or-airflow","blocked-fridge-internal-vents"],t.s)
