B.Wk=new A.dQ("inspect-fridge-vents","Look at the internal air vents","Stay inside the compartments. Do not open the sealed cooling system. No live electrical testing. No compressor live diagnostics.","Inside the fridge and freezer, find the slotted air vents on a back or side wall. Look whether bins, bottles, or food cover those openings.","The vent slots are visible and not covered by food or bins.","Food, bins, or a sheet of ice covers the vent openings.","fridge","fridge-internal-vents",B.dA,B.a7U,"fridge-internal-vents")
B.aEh=new A.i1()
